Set the owner of an object.

usage: @chown <object> <owner>

Sets the %owner of an object to a character. The object is a cache id and the
owner is a character id, for example:

  @chown programs/greeter chars/1

The owner must be a character (a chars/ id) and must exist. A resident program
must have an owner before it can be launched as an agent, because an agent runs
with its object's owner's authority.

Wizard only.
